1
00:00:00,432 --> 00:00:02,563
Can ChatGPT watch YouTube videos?

2
00:00:03,156 --> 00:00:05,592
Paste a link and it can't read a word
that's said in it.

3
00:00:06,841 --> 00:00:07,841
Here is the fix.

4
00:00:08,348 --> 00:00:13,187
Open the TranscriptX transcription MCP
page and click Add to ChatGPT.

5
00:00:14,533 --> 00:00:17,209
ChatGPT opens the TranscriptX plugin.

6
00:00:17,737 --> 00:00:18,891
Click Install Plugin.

7
00:00:20,141 --> 00:00:23,105
Click Allow to sign in or continue as a
guest.

8
00:00:23,506 --> 00:00:24,506
No account needed.

9
00:00:25,669 --> 00:00:27,335
Now pick TranscriptX type.

10
00:00:27,672 --> 00:00:29,917
Transcribe this video and paste your link.

11
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:35,609
In seconds, the full transcript is right
in the chat with timestamps ready to copy

12
00:00:35,609 --> 00:00:36,609
or export.

13
00:00:37,376 --> 00:00:40,888
Using Claude, click Add to Claude and it
works the same way.

14
00:00:42,171 --> 00:00:46,229
Add TranscriptX to ChatGPT or Claude free
at transcripts.ai.
